{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gcatDzSy4O1793656041.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>烏克蘭指控俄羅斯軍方，空襲扎波羅熱的學校及避難所，釀成至少18人死亡。</p><p></p><p>烏克蘭總統澤連斯基周二表示，俄軍當天空襲烏克蘭南部扎波羅熱科米舒瓦哈地區施襲，多枚炸彈擊中發放人道物資的學校及避難所，另有逾30人受傷及失蹤。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UKR.RUS-0500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264evd88Cpix1793656039.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>俄烏雙方過去周日在奧列什基地區結束局部停火。赫爾松行政首長稱，俄軍無人機襲擊當地醫療設施。克里姆林宮就稱，關注有黑客攻擊緊急警報應用程式發放虛假消息，據報有烏克蘭用戶收到「核威脅」的假訊息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:40:39.821542+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T21:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.180058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T22:38:14.295103+00:00","content_hash":"0d3d08eb6d0fba0111a82d30a977e9118fffb26ceb9567e068493598f355e423","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:40:39.821542+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}